;			    CHANGE HISTORY 
;  
;   Date      version     Who                       Description  
; ----------  -------    ---------   -------------------------------------------------   
; 04/26/2005   1.0a    K.M.Liu      1) New crated.  
;                                   2) Separated two directories which one is for using UTM process  
;				        and another is for none UTM process.  
;  
; 02/13/2006   1.2a    K.M.Liu	     1) revised baseband resistors coding style 
;	                             2) Modify the geomStamp to resolve multiStamp issue 
;				     3) added rnpolys, rppolys, rpods, rnods extractRES 
;                                   4) changed ND(MOS),PD(MOS) to nmos3v(MOS),pmos3v(MOS) 
;			    	        to solve LVS multi-to-multi conflict in Assura v3.1.4 
;				     5) removed gates in RFDMY from "floating gate" error 
;				     6) added tsmc13rf ivpcell reference to all extracts 
;				     7) changed ivpcell name of 'nmos_rf33' and 'pmos_rf33' 
;				     8) changed area tolerance of diode to 0.01% (for Assura tool bug) 
;				     9) fixed NPN base terminal short issue 
;				    10) fixed 'spiral_std' pin swap issue (for w/i UTM decks) 
;				    11) fixed skill routine failed issue (parMC->parRF) 
;				    12) redefined 'ntap' 
;				    13) added 'bind_cdl.rul' for CDL flow users 
;				    14) added '-res_blocking' option in capgen.cmd 
; 
; 03/02/2007   1.3bp1  Karena Lin   1) add floating well check in ERC 
;                                   2) revised the compare rule of devices merging 
; 
; 06/20/2007   1.3b    Karena Lin   1) Add cell name of 2-terminal resistors 
;                                      R(WO) -->  rnwellod_2T 
;				        R(PD) -->  rpplus_2T 
;			                R(PI) -->  rplplus_2T 
;				        R(ND) -->  rnplus_2T 
;				        R(NI) -->  rnlplus_2T 
;				     2) Support 1P4M LVS command file. 
; 
; 09/09/2008   1.3c    Karena Lin   1) Add switch "FILTER_DGS_TIED_MOS" 
;	  	                     2) Revised the logic operation of half-turn spiral_std 
;			             3) Revised the skill code of parallel merge of RF resistors 
;			             4) Removed the skill code of series merge of RF resistors 
; 
; 08/03/2009   v1.4a   tmwub	     1) Update resistance table. 
;				     2) This LVS deck is developed and qualified by Assura AV41, crtmom and rf devices 
;					are using cell blocking to block R & C and their rcxLayers are removed. 
;				     3) Add devices sbd_rf and sbd_rf_nw 
;				     4) Revise crtmom's finger count and metal interconnect. 
;				     5) Add 5 ERC check switches in LVS.rsf file.  
;                                          WELL_TO_PG_CHECK   : Default is on. Set on to highlight if nwell connects to ground or   
;                                                                       psub connects to power.   
;                                          GATE_TO_PG_CHECK   : Default is off. Set on to highlight if a mos gate directly    
;                                                                       connects to power or ground.   
;                                          DS_TO_PG_CHECK     : Default is on. Set on to highlight if drain connects to power and    
;                                                                       source connects to ground.   
;                                          FLOATING_WELL_CHECK: Default is on. Set on to highlight if well does not connect to    
;                                                                       power or ground. Exclude the nwell of moscaps, nwell-resistor    
;                                                                       terminals.   
;					    FLOATING_GATE_CHECK: Default is on. Turn on to highlight if there are floating gates.  
;				     6) mnpg and mpgg ERC check include all mos, but exclude rf mos.   
;				     7) Rename cellview of nchpd_sr from error_4t to nchpd_sr.                 
;				        Rename cellview of pchpu_sr from error_4t to pchpu_sr.                 
;				        Rename cellview of nchpd_hvtsr from error_4t to nchpd_hvtsr. 
;				        Rename cellview of pchpu_hvtsr from error_4t to pchpu_hvtsr. 
;				        Rename cellview of dio_esd25 from error_2t to dio_esd25 and model name in low case. 
; 12/20/2011   v1.4b R.H.Zhang        1) Set RPO as must layer for LV BJT and revise spiral_std auxiliary layer for nr 
;                                     2) Add power name "TVDD" "VDDESD" , ground name "TACVSS" "TVSS" "VSSESD" 
;                                     3) Use switch extract_parasitic_diodes and compare_parasitic_diodes to replace switch extract_dnwdio. 
;                                     4) ERC floating well check enhancement for tool performance improvement 
;                                     5) Update capgen.cmd to support mimcap for RC extraction 
;                                     6) Add attachparameter "wPerFinger" for nch, nch_25, pch, pch_25 for PDK 
; 
